    "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Progress Updates</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/4e01125cf933200e5dab6a7a30ef9977.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=256 /></span><br><br>\u2022 The game has been optimized for better performance on all systems<br>\u2022 We added many cats and dogs the player can interact with and observe in the world<br>\u2022 Implemented user interfaces for many of the game's features, namely the veterinary store, the player's phone, dialogue with NPCs and dog owners, home and pause menus<br>\u2022 Implemented the veterinary store, where the player can adopt dogs as pets and purchase many cosmetics and power-ups<br>\u2022 Implemented a dog-walking job system, for all prospective dog walkers to make a living off of, with varying difficulties and payouts<br>\u2022 Various visual updates such as better post-processing, lighting updates, new and optimized textures for lots of items and structures<br>\u2022 Various gameplay updates and bug fixes</p><br><h1>Discord</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/4e01125cf933200e5dab6a7a30ef9977.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=256 /></span><br><br>\u2022 The game has been optimized for better performance on all systems<br>\u2022 We added many cats and dogs the player can interact with and observe in the world<br>\u2022 Implemented user interfaces for many of the game's features, namely the veterinary store, the player's phone, dialogue with NPCs and dog owners, home and pause menus<br>\u2022 Implemented the veterinary store, where the player can adopt dogs as pets and purchase many cosmetics and power-ups<br>\u2022 Implemented a dog-walking job system, for all prospective dog walkers to make a living off of, with varying difficulties and payouts<br>\u2022 Various visual updates such as better post-processing, lighting updates, new and optimized textures for lots of items and structures<br>\u2022 Various gameplay updates and bug fixes</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/9c301bb0c8a461d976f1d4633beda006.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Dog Walking Simulator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a dog walker and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the surface of your seemingly mundane profession. Are you ready to forge a bond with your furry companions and unravel the mysteries of the city's underworld? Take the leash and embark on an unforgettable journey in Dog Walking Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Dog Walking</strong>: Strap on your leash and venture into the streets to walk dogs, earn money, and increase your rating. Upgrade your home and means of transportation to take on higher-status dogs for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/b4c360ec2c5b2f2899b3bc1818a6aad8.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience</strong>: Experience dog walking as never before, as you will interact with different dog breeds, get a dog and take care of it, and work developing your own business in the dog caring industry. Manage your stamina and money, and life satisfaction as you progress in the business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/a2081ffdfcbd5f63df3b95e92537ab83.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong>: Explore a branching storyline filled with colourful characters, including dog owners ranging from lower-class citizens to high-profile figures, each with unique personalities and connections to the main plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/NPC_s.JPG?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong>: Navigate through detailed locations, from bustling city streets to decrepit back alleys, encountering a diverse cast of NPCs with their reactions to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/c2f1a59824a10fe6cd7c0a57180b999e.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Stories</strong>: Face unpredictable challenges and moral dilemmas as you balance your responsibilities as a dog walker with the dangers lurking in the shadows of the city's underworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/c59708b29e7a017644349e6d5290db31.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/9c301bb0c8a461d976f1d4633beda006.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Dog Walking Simulator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a dog walker and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the surface of your seemingly mundane profession. Are you ready to forge a bond with your furry companions and unravel the mysteries of the city's underworld? Take the leash and embark on an unforgettable journey in Dog Walking Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Dog Walking</strong>: Strap on your leash and venture into the streets to walk dogs, earn money, and increase your rating. Upgrade your home and means of transportation to take on higher-status dogs for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/b4c360ec2c5b2f2899b3bc1818a6aad8.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience</strong>: Experience dog walking as never before, as you will interact with different dog breeds, get a dog and take care of it, and work developing your own business in the dog caring industry. Manage your stamina and money, and life satisfaction as you progress in the business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/a2081ffdfcbd5f63df3b95e92537ab83.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong>: Explore a branching storyline filled with colourful characters, including dog owners ranging from lower-class citizens to high-profile figures, each with unique personalities and connections to the main plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/NPC_s.JPG?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong>: Navigate through detailed locations, from bustling city streets to decrepit back alleys, encountering a diverse cast of NPCs with their reactions to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/c2f1a59824a10fe6cd7c0a57180b999e.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Stories</strong>: Face unpredictable challenges and moral dilemmas as you balance your responsibilities as a dog walker with the dangers lurking in the shadows of the city's underworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854520/extras/c59708b29e7a017644349e6d5290db31.avif?t=1747994057\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dog Walking Simulator: Become a professional dog walker! Walk a menagerie of dogs and do your best to keep them happy, healthy, and satisfied. Adopt and take care of your own pets and even open your own dog-related business!",
